chip ymf278b
clock 33868800
samples 16000
mem pcm wavetable.bin
# Damping (register 0x68 bit 6): decay at rate 48 to -12dB, then at the
# fastest rate. Set with the key on mid-note, with the key off during a
# slow release, at the key on itself, and cleared again.
0 w 2 05 3 03  # NEW and NEW2: OPL4 mode
0 w 4 20 5 00 4 38 5 02 4 50 5 01 4 08 5 02 4 68 5 00 4 c8 5 f2 4 68 5 80
2000 w 4 68 5 c0  # damp under the key
3000 w 4 68 5 00
4000 w 4 21 5 00 4 39 5 10 4 51 5 01 4 09 5 00 4 69 5 00 4 c9 5 f2 4 69 5 80
5000 w 4 69 5 00  # a slow release
5600 w 4 69 5 40  # damp during it
7000 w 4 22 5 00 4 3a 5 04 4 52 5 01 4 0a 5 01 4 6a 5 c0  # damp from the key on
8500 w 4 6a 5 80  # damp cleared under the key
10500 w 4 6a 5 00
11000 w 4 23 5 00 4 3b 5 10 4 53 5 01 4 0b 5 02 4 6b 5 00 4 b3 5 00 4 6b 5 80
11010 w 4 6b 5 c0
11020 w 4 6b 5 80  # damp for 10 samples only
14000 w 4 6b 5 00
